{
    "title": "Winn-Dixie",
    "description": "Join the Winner\u2019s Circle \r\n\r\nSay hello to earning rewards like never before with every purchase you make. The Winn-Dixie app is your ticket to scoring big and saving bigger on your grocery hauls. Imagine a world where every shopping trip means more than just filling your cart \u2013 it means earning points towards FREE groceries and exclusive member perks! Explore why our grocery app is essential for simplify your shopping. \r\n\r\n**Score Deals & Coupons**\r\nSay farewell to ordinary shopping and embrace extraordinary deals! With the Winn-Dixie app, access coupons, our weekly ad, and personalized offers right at your fingertips. You'll be saving even more on your favorite products with tailored deals just for you, plus a dedicated Rewards tab for coupons and points. And the cherry on top? Discover BOGO offers in the Weekly Ad for your store and easily add them to your shopping list. \r\n\r\n**Earn Points**\r\nEasily monitor your points within the app and unlock bonus offers in the REWARDS tab, including a game-changing points multiplier that skyrockets your rewards. \r\n\r\n**Build Your Shopping Lists**\r\nSimplify your upcoming shopping trip using our Shopping List. Craft multiple lists, find items, uncover coupons, and easily share them with friends. No more worries about forgetting essential items \u2013 we've got you covered!\r\n\r\nIt's time to shop smarter, score more, and celebrate those savings like a true Winner. \r\nDownload the Winn-Dixie app today and dive into a world of convenience and rewards that are simply out of this world!\r\n\r\nKeep up with us on socials and stay up to date with the latest news and offers\r\nFollow us on Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/winndixie \r\nLike us on Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/winndixie",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join the Winner\u2019s Circle <br><br>Say hello to earning rewards like never before with every purchase you make. The Winn-Dixie app is your ticket to scoring big and saving bigger on your grocery hauls. Imagine a world where every shopping trip means more than just filling your cart \u2013 it means earning points towards FREE groceries and exclusive member perks! Explore why our grocery app is essential for simplify your shopping. <br><br>**Score Deals &amp; Coupons**<br>Say farewell to ordinary shopping and embrace extraordinary deals! With the Winn-Dixie app, access coupons, our weekly ad, and personalized offers right at your fingertips. You&#39;ll be saving even more on your favorite products with tailored deals just for you, plus a dedicated Rewards tab for coupons and points. And the cherry on top? Discover BOGO offers in the Weekly Ad for your store and easily add them to your shopping list. <br><br>**Earn Points**<br>Easily monitor your points within the app and unlock bonus offers in the REWARDS tab, including a game-changing points multiplier that skyrockets your rewards. <br><br>**Build Your Shopping Lists**<br>Simplify your upcoming shopping trip using our Shopping List. Craft multiple lists, find items, uncover coupons, and easily share them with friends. No more worries about forgetting essential items \u2013 we&#39;ve got you covered!<br><br>It&#39;s time to shop smarter, score more, and celebrate those savings like a true Winner. <br>Download the Winn-Dixie app today and dive into a world of convenience and rewards that are simply out of this world!<br><br>Keep up with us on socials and stay up to date with the latest news and offers<br>Follow us on Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/winndixie <br>Like us on Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/winndixie",
